# Repo-root .dockerignore — trims the Docker build context for the dev image builds
# (Dockerfile.app / Dockerfile.worker both COPY . . from the repo root).
# Excluding node_modules drops a ~1.3GB context transfer AND avoids
# ERR_PNPM_ABORTED_REMOVE_MODULES_DIR_NO_TTY (pnpm refusing to purge a copied-in
# modules dir without a TTY). Source, prisma schema, pnpm-lock.yaml, package.json,
# and tsconfig are intentionally NOT excluded — the builds need them.
**/node_modules
.git
**/.next
**/dist
**/build
test-artifacts
screenshots
**/*.log
.env
.env.*
# ...but keep the committed example env in context.
!.env.example
